# NOTE: parkinson_app/lib/firebase_options.dart IS tracked on purpose —
# Firebase client keys are public identifiers and the app won't run
# without it. Regenerate anytime via `flutterfire configure`.

# Raw research datasets (~180MB) + archives — documented downloads, not code
